* ============================================================================
* 17_substance_heterogeneity.do — Table 4 异质性 (P3 bank_fintech_substance)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: §5.5.2 P3 heterogeneity (R6-M03/M04 + R7-m01)
*
* 异质性维度 (按 R7-m01 不做全笛卡尔积组合):
*   (a) 4 类银行类型 × 是否国有 (SOE)
*   (b) fintech 浪潮分段 (pre/wave_1/wave_2/consolidation/wave_3)
*   (c) 资本充足率四分位 (capital_ratio quartiles)
*   (d) 2013 年前 fintech 暴露 (连续交互项)
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* ============================================================================
* (a) 4 类银行类型 × SOE
* ============================================================================
* st-did-05 fix (2026-06-03): (1) bank_type 是字符串列 (str), levelsof 产出字符串 token
* ('soe'/'joint'/'city'/'rural'/...; 见 iv_did.py::load_bank_group_maps + runner.py:857).
* 旧 `bank_type == `t'` 宏未加引号 → StataNow 19.5 触发 r(198) invalid syntax. 改为
* `bank_type == "`t'"` (宏外加双引号, 对齐 attention/17:37,39). (2) SOE 二元列在面板中
* 实名 `is_soe` (int64), 非 `soe`; 旧 `confirm variable ... soe` 会缺列致整个 (a) 块静默跳过,
* 旧 `soe == `s'` 引用幻影列. 改为 `is_soe` (数值比较, == `s' 正确无需引号).
capture confirm variable bank_type is_soe
if !_rc {
    levelsof bank_type, local(types)
    foreach t of local types {
        forval s = 0/1 {
            count if bank_type == "`t'" & is_soe == `s' & !missing({{MAIN_TREAT}}, {{MAIN_DV}})
            if r(N) >= 10 {
                reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls if bank_type == "`t'" & is_soe == `s', ///
                    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
                eststo type_`t'_soe_`s'
            }
            else {
                display "  [SKIP] bank_type=`t' is_soe=`s' has " r(N) " obs (< 10; R7-m01)"
            }
        }
    }
}

* ============================================================================
* (b) Fintech 浪潮分段
* ============================================================================
foreach w in wave_1 wave_2 consolidation wave_3 {
    capture confirm variable `w'
    if !_rc {
        reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls if `w' == 1, ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
        eststo wave_`w'
    }
}

* ============================================================================
* (c) 资本充足率四分位
* ============================================================================
capture confirm variable capital_ratio
if !_rc {
    * fix(omni-g-templates-02, 2026-06-11): 分位改按年内切 (by-year xtile)。旧版在
    * pooled bank-year 全样本上切四分位: 全量 T=18 下 capital_ratio 因 Basel III
    * 阶段达标系统性上行 → Q1 被早年观测占满 / Q4 被晚年占满, "资本充足度异质性"
    * 混入年代异质性; 且 t 年观测的阈值由含未来年份的 in-sample 分布决定 (前视泄漏)。
    * Stata 原生 xtile 无 by() — 用年份循环逐年切分实现 within-year quartiles。
    * 白话: 每一年单独把银行按资本充足率分四档, 而不是把全部年份混在一起分 —
    *       否则早年银行全挤在低档、晚年全在高档, 比的就不是资本而是年代了。
    gen cap_q = .
    quietly levelsof year, local(_capq_yrs)
    foreach y of local _capq_yrs {
        capture xtile _capq_tmp = capital_ratio if year == `y', n(4)
        if !_rc {
            replace cap_q = _capq_tmp if year == `y'
            drop _capq_tmp
        }
        else {
            capture drop _capq_tmp
            display "  [SKIP] year `y': within-year capital_ratio quartile 切分失败 (单元过小)"
        }
    }
    forval q = 1/4 {
        count if cap_q == `q' & !missing({{MAIN_TREAT}}, {{MAIN_DV}})
        if r(N) >= 10 {
            reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls if cap_q == `q', ///
                absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
            eststo cap_q_`q'
        }
        else {
            display "  [SKIP] cap_q=`q' has " r(N) " obs (< 10; R7-m01)"
        }
    }
}

* ============================================================================
* (d) 2013 年前 fintech 暴露 × treatment (连续交互)
* ============================================================================
capture confirm variable pre_2013_fintech_exposure
if !_rc {
    gen treat_x_pre2013 = {{MAIN_TREAT}} * pre_2013_fintech_exposure
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} pre_2013_fintech_exposure treat_x_pre2013 $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo pre2013_interact
}

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — 旧版硬点名 pre2013_interact
* (守卫跳过后 r(111) 丢整表) + 通配 type_*/wave_*/cap_q_* 零匹配同样 r(111)。本文件
* 开头 clear all 已清空估计命名空间, estimates dir 即本表全部家族估计。
qui estimates dir
local models `r(names)'
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] Table 4 无任何已存储估计 (全部切分被守卫跳过), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/table4_heterogeneity.tex", replace ///
        star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
        title("Table 4 — Heterogeneity (P3 substance; bank type × SOE × wave × capital quartile)") ///
        addnotes("Small-cell warning (R7-m01): cell N<10 skipped." ///
                 "Capital-ratio quartiles computed within year (by-year xtile) to avoid cohort confounding.")

    * fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel — papers/bank_fintech_substance/
    * tables.py:build_table4_heterogeneity 经 read_paper_esttab(..., 'table4_heterogeneity.csv') 消费。
    estout `models' using "$tables_dir/table4_heterogeneity.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
        cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
        starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01)

    display "[OK] Table 4 (heterogeneity) → $tables_dir/table4_heterogeneity.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
}
